{"t":"HOOD","made":"2026-11-11 10:29","name":"Robinhood Markets, Inc.","ko":"로빈후드","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","employees":2900,"hq":"Menlo Park, CA, United States","website":"https://robinhood.com","summary_en":"Robinhood Markets, Inc. operates financial services platform in the United States. The company's platform allows users to invest in stocks, exchange-traded funds (ETFs), and American depository receipts. It offers fractional trading, recurring investments, access to investing on margin, fully-paid securities lending, cash sweep, instant withdrawals, retirement program, around-the-clock trading, joint investing accounts, event contracts, future contract services, and short selling. The company also provides various learning and education solutions comprise Snacks, an accessible digest of business news stories for a new generation of investors; Learn, which is an online collection of guides, feature tutorials, and financial dictionary; Newsfeeds that offer access to free, premium news from sites from various sites, such as Barron's, Reuters, and Dow Jones. In addition, the company offers In-App Education, a resource that covers investing fundamentals, including why people invest, a stock market overview, and tips on how to define investing goals, as well as allows customers to understand the basics of investing before their first trade; and Crypto Learn and Earn, an educational module available to various crypto customers through Robinhood Learn to teach customers the basics related to cryptocurrency. Further, it provides Robinhood credit cards, cash card and spending accounts, and wallets. Robinhood Markets, Inc. was incorporated in 2013 and is headquartered in Menlo Park, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Robinhood Markets, Inc.는 미국에서 금융 서비스 플랫폼을 운영하고 있습니다. 회사의 플랫폼을 통해 사용자는 주식, 상장지수펀드(ETF) 및 미국 예탁증서에 투자할 수 있습니다. 부분 거래, 반복 투자, 마진 투자 이용, 전액 지불된 증권 대출, 현금 스윕, 즉시 인출, 퇴직 프로그램, 24시간 거래, 공동 투자 계좌, 이벤트 계약, 미래 계약 서비스 및 공매도를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 차세대 투자자를 위한 비즈니스 뉴스 요약인 Snacks로 구성된 다양한 학습 및 교육 솔루션을 제공합니다. 학습(Learn)은 가이드, 기능 튜토리얼, 금융 사전의 온라인 모음입니다. Barron's, Reuters, Dow Jones 등 다양한 사이트의 무료 프리미엄 뉴스에 대한 액세스를 제공하는 뉴스피드입니다. 또한 이 회사는 사람들이 투자하는 이유, 주식 시장 개요, 투자 목표를 정의하는 방법에 대한 팁 등 투자 기본 사항을 다루는 리소스인 인앱 교육을 제공할 뿐만 아니라 고객이 첫 거래 전에 투자의 기본 사항을 이해할 수 있도록 합니다. 그리고 Robinhood Learn을 통해 다양한 암호화폐 고객에게 제공되는 교육 모듈인 Crypto Learn and Earn은 고객에게 암호화폐 관련 기본 사항을 가르칩니다. 또한 Robinhood 신용 카드, 현금 카드 및 지출 계정 및 지갑을 제공합니다. 로빈후드 마켓, Inc. 2013년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 멘로파크에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":81.33,"mcap":73236955136.0,"pe":37.479263,"fpe":23.837019,"peg":1.3508,"ps":14.41105,"pb":7.327027,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":0.0,"beta":2.528,"hi52":139.75,"lo52":63.515},"fin":{"rev":5081999872.0,"rev_g":0.118,"eps_g":-0.164,"gross":0.90988,"op":0.48104,"net":0.39040002,"roe":0.21452999,"fcf":null,"cash":24828999680.0,"debt":22552000512.0,"de":223.775,"eps":2.17,"feps":3.41192},"own":{"short":0.0465,"inst":0.79277,"insider":0.00953},"analyst":{"n":30,"mean":128.87132,"median":130.0,"high":170.0,"low":59.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.65625,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":20,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":20,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":18,"hold":3,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":18,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":123.0,"priorPriceTarget":125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":120.0,"priorPriceTarget":150.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":114.0,"priorPriceTarget":115